{"type":"message","id":"f7b45543","parentId":"534e78f3","timestamp":"2026-03-21T04:02:10.879Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"看起来在这个工作区不允许指定agentId。让我直接在当前会话中执行，使用 xiaohongshu-cover-generator 技能。但首先我需要了解如何调用这个技能。\n\n让我看看系统中是否有这个技术的相关信息，或者查看一下如何调用它。\n\n从之前的 openclaw skills list 输出中，我看到：\n✓ ready   │ 📦 xiaohongshu-cover-generator   │ 生成小红书风格封面图...\n\n这个技能描述提到使用 Doubao Seedream 模型或仓颉 API。我需要更多了解如何使用这个技能。让我查看工作区根目录下的 skills 文件夹。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n让我尝试直接调用这个技能（根据系统信息，skill的路径在 openclaw-workspace）：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d0e8ec067bd47f3455ca4dfef6dc0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find ~/.openclaw -name \"xiaohongshu-cover-generator\" -type d 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":707,"output":303,"cacheRead":35328,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36338,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774065717730}}
