{"type":"message","id":"600fb1dd","parentId":"07726d5b","timestamp":"2026-03-21T04:02:15.327Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"找到了！现在让我看看这个技能的详细信息，了解如何调用它。让我读取 SKILL.md 文件。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d0e8ed36d793cc37591a00f63ca7a","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":222,"output":82,"cacheRead":36032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36336,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774065731192}}
{"type":"message","id":"88a3d62d","parentId":"600fb1dd","timestamp":"2026-03-21T04:02:15.342Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"019d0e8ed36d793cc37591a00f63ca7a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: xiaohongshu-cover-generator\ndescription: 生成小红书风格封面图。支持两种生图方式：(1) Doubao Seedream 模型（需配置 Ark API），(2) 仓颉 API。用户可通过 --model 参数选择模型。当用户提到\"小红书封面\"\"配图生成\"\"封面图\"时触发。\n---\n\n# 小红书封面生成器\n\n支持多种模型的 AI 封面图生成工具。\n\n## 使用方法\n\n```bash\n# 进入技能目录\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\n\n# 生成封面图\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"你的封面主题\" [选项]\n```\n\n## 选项\n\n| 参数 | 简写 | 说明 | 默认值 |\n|------|------|------|--------|\n| `--model` | `-m` | 生图模型 | `doubao-seedream-5-0` |\n| `--api-key` | `-k` | 仓颉 API Key | 环境变量 `CANGHE_API_KEY` |\n| `--output` | `-o` | 输出路径 | `xiaohongshu-cover-{timestamp}.png` |\n| `--size` | `-s` | 图片尺寸 | `1920x2560` |\n\n## 可用模型\n\n### 推荐：Doubao Seedream 系列（免费，已配置）\n\n| 模型 ID | 说明 |\n|---------|------|\n| `doubao-seedream-5-0` | Seedream 5.0 最新版 ⭐ |\n| `doubao-seedream-4-5` | Seedream 4.5 版 |\n| `doubao-seedream-4-0` | Seedream 4.0 版 |\n\n### 仓颉 API（需 API Key）\n\n| 模型 ID | 说明 |\n|---------|------|\n| `canghe` | 仓颉默认模型（需 Key） |\n\n## 使用示例\n\n### 示例 1：用 Doubao Seedream 5.0 生成\n```bash\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"苹果紧急警告！4.2万台iPhone被入侵\" -m doubao-seedream-5-0\n```\n\n### 示例 2：用 Seedream 4.5 生成（更快）\n```bash\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"副业干货分享\" -m doubao-seedream-4-5\n```\n\n### 示例 3：用仓颉 API 生成\n```bash\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"今日穿搭分享\" -m canghe -k \"sk-xxx\"\n```\n\n或设置环境变量：\n```bash\nexport CANGHE_API_KEY=\"sk-xxx\"\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"今日穿搭分享\" -m canghe\n```\n\n### 示例 4：自定义输出和尺寸\n```bash\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"我的封面\" -o \"/root/my-cover.png\" -s \"1080x1440\"\n```\n\n## 输出\n\n图片默认保存到：\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspace/xiaohongshu-cover-{时间戳}.png`\n\n如指定路径，则保存到指定位置。\n\n## 注意事项\n\n1. **Doubao 模型**：已预配置 Ark API Key，免费使用\n2. **仓颉 API**：需要 Key，无 Key 时可使用 Doubao 模型\n3. **尺寸要求**：最小 3686400 像素（约 1920x1920）\n4. **比例**：推荐 3:4 (1920x2560) 适合小红书\n\n## 推荐工作流\n\n1. 首选 `doubao-seedream-5-0`：效果最好\n2. 如果5.0响应慢，用 `doubao-seedream-4-5`\n3. 仓颉 API 作为备选"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774065735334}}
{"type":"message","id":"25b40959","parentId":"88a3d62d","timestamp":"2026-03-21T04:02:25.893Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我了解了如何使用这个技能。我需要运行handler.py来生成3张小红书图片。让我准备3张图片的内容，每张包含3-4个skills的信息。\n\n根据技能说明，我需要运行：\n```bash\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"封面主题内容\" -m doubao-seedream-5-0\n```\n\n让我生成3张图片。\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n现在我了解了如何使用这个技能。让我生成3张小红书图片：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d0e8eefb2706fb0e62c990b8ffdb8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator && python3 scripts/handler.py \"🤖 OpenClaw Top Skills (1/3) 📕\\n\\n① Self-Improving Agent\\n▸ 自主学习改进，记录错误和学习笔记到markdown，持续优化AI表现\\n\\n② Find Skills\\n▸ 发现安装skills，发现并安装AI agent技能库中的技能\\n\\n③ Summarize\\n▸ 快速总结内容，支持长文本摘要提取\" -m doubao-seedream-5-0","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":1077,"output":309,"cacheRead":36032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":37418,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774065735341}}
