{"type":"message","id":"8f9bdf27","parentId":"a03f9eff","timestamp":"2026-03-21T11:42:36.337Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"需要按技能规则读取 SKILL.md。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04df422acd63fe200169be842b2ab08191857f85c31f1743ea\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_j5frOq6yDc1blmIySgu7ZAVk|fc_04df422acd63fe200169be842b97a4819181f5d9ad92f68efa","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-canghe/SKILL.md"},"partialJson":"{\"path\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-canghe/SKILL.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":140,"output":54,"cacheRead":67456,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67650,"cost":{"input":0.00035000000000000005,"output":0.0008100000000000001,"cacheRead":0.016864,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.018024000000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774093352567}}
{"type":"message","id":"7aadd53c","parentId":"8f9bdf27","timestamp":"2026-03-21T11:42:36.359Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_j5frOq6yDc1blmIySgu7ZAVk|fc_04df422acd63fe200169be842b97a4819181f5d9ad92f68efa","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: xiaohongshu-canghe\ndescription: 基于 freestylefly/xiaohongshu-skills 改造的小红书封面生成技能。支持根据自定义主题生成精美的小红书封面图，默认可使用 doubao-seedream-5-0，也支持 doubao-seedream-4-5 与 canghe。适用于用户提到“小红书封面”“小红书配图”“封面图”“笔记封面”“标题海报”时。\n---\n\n# 小红书封面生成器（xiaohongshu-canghe）\n\n这是在 `freestylefly/xiaohongshu-skills` 基础上改造的版本。\n\n## 默认行为\n\n- 默认模型：`doubao-seedream-5-0`\n- 备选模型：`doubao-seedream-4-5`\n- 兼容模型：`canghe`\n- 默认尺寸：`1920x2560`\n- 输出文件：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/xiaohongshu-canghe-{timestamp}.png`\n\n## 使用方式\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"你的封面主题\"\n```\n\n### 指定模型\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"你的封面主题\" -m doubao-seedream-4-5\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"你的封面主题\" -m canghe -k \"your-canghe-api-key\"\n```\n\n### 自定义尺寸与输出\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/handler.py \"你的封面主题\" \\\n  -m doubao-seedream-5-0 \\\n  -s 1080x1440 \\\n  -o /root/.openclaw/workspace/my-cover-{ts}.png\n```\n\n## 参数\n\n- `prompt`：封面主题 / 需求描述\n- `--model`, `-m`：模型，可选 `doubao-seedream-5-0`、`doubao-seedream-4-5`、`canghe`\n- `--api-key`, `-k`：仓颉 API Key，仅 `canghe` 模型需要\n- `--size`, `-s`：尺寸，默认 `1920x2560`\n- `--output`, `-o`：输出路径模板，可用 `{ts}` 或 `{timestamp}` 占位\n\n## 推荐工作流\n\n1. 首选 `doubao-seedream-5-0`\n2. 如果 5.0 不可用或效果不理想，切 `doubao-seedream-4-5`\n3. 如确需兼容原仓颉链路，再用 `canghe`\n\n## 说明\n\n- Doubao 模型已复用当前工作区既有 Ark 配置\n- `canghe` 仍需显式传入 API Key 或设置 `CANGHE_API_KEY`\n- 主题描述越具体，结果越稳定\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774093356346}}
